      <description>&lt;p&gt;The time has come to look for a new car. I was out with Katja running some errands. We passed by this truck which of her own volition she pointed out to me. She said as we walked by:” Big truck”. My thought is that this might be a candidate for a new family car.  It can fit a 4′ x 8′ sheet of plywood and a car seat in the back seat. Seems to fit our requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
